<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Friday, April 25, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on May 14, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry.  DTC is pending.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers</p>
